      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Because my mother worries about the health of our family, she prepares many different kinds of healthy side dishes.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "My favorite food is (bulgogi).",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We always have great conversations at dinnertime.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Usually, my father comes home late, so we can’t be together at suppertime.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Dinnertime is the only time that our family can get together the entire day.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We mostly talk about the interesting things that happened to us during the day.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
